{"channelId":"UCXxecStOVX__bNoNNA_ZcIA","row":["Noble Choice Chiropractic",77,"Welcome to Noble Choice Chiropractic\n\nAt Noble Choice Chiropractic, our mission is simple: help you move better, feel better, and perform at your highest level.\n\nWe proudly serve the communities of Sun Prairie, DeForest, Waunakee, and Madison—working with individuals of all ages, with a special focus on active adults who want more out of their health and performance.\n\nOn this channel, you’ll find practical, easy-to-understand guidance on:\n\nNeck and low back pain\nHeadaches and migraines\nPlantar fasciitis, tennis elbow, and joint injuries\nMobility, movement, and performance optimization\n\nBut this isn’t just about treating pain—it’s about helping you understand your body so you can stay active, resilient, and in control of your health long-term.\n\nYou’ll also get a behind-the-scenes look at our clinic, our team, and how we live out what we teach—both in the office and at home.\n\nIf you’re ready to move better, perform better, and live healthier… you’re in the right place.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXxecStOVX__bNoNNA_ZcIA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXxecStOVX__bNoNNA_ZcIA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:58.019Z","channelId":"UCXxecStOVX__bNoNNA_ZcIA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a1f5ea968f4494430cf1d6ac401171adcf90222420d1c4d05a4b587c1b28fe91","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e5233cfc186bc1b1be4c6747f1f2abfc25ddc8b0268ca30a7ae30ab36b8f8f45"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXxecStOVX__bNoNNA_ZcIA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":77,"raw":"77 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXxecStOVX__bNoNNA_ZcIA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:58.019Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"chi